<title>SPAIN: Yields rise at Spain 3-, 10-yr debt auction.</title>
<headline>Yields rise at Spain 3-, 10-yr debt auction.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE	Yield    Pvs     Price     Pvs	Bid    Allocated</p>
<p>3-year     7.698    7.671   99.35    98.80   342.346  178.744</p>
<p>10-year    8.921    8.757  102.50   102.80   155.684   94.584</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
